OL,3,GNEWSANew baroness 'to bang drum for
OL,4,ANorth' in Lords
OL,5,
OL,6,FWest Yorkshire's deputy mayor has
OL,7,Fpromised to champion "the rights of
OL,8,Fpeople in the North" after being sworn
OL,9,Finto the House of Lords.
OL,11,FAlison Lowe became Baroness Lowe of
OL,12,FArmley, in honour of the ward she
OL,13,Frepresented as a Leeds city councillor
OL,14,Ffor 29 years, at a ceremony on Tuesday.
OL,16,FLowe, who has been West Yorkshire's
OL,17,Fdeputy mayor with responsibility for
OL,18,Fpolicing and crime since 2021, said she
OL,19,Fwas "gobsmacked" to have been appointed
OL,20,Fto the upper chamber.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
