OL,3,GNEWSANew baroness 'to bang drum for
OL,4,ANorth' in Lords
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe added that the role, which she said
OL,7,Fwas "the honour of my life", would not
OL,8,Fcompromise her job as deputy mayor for
OL,9,Fpolicing and crime in the region, which
OL,10,Fshe is due to continue until 2028.
